        <p>ALTERATION OF RULES</p>
        <p>On the motion of Mr. Sp lakman, seconded by Mr. A. McCoy, the following new rule affeclng bowang was a.doptld :—" That any memb3c who shall play in any priva'se match for any sum, staked or unstaked, exceed- ing one &amp;lilting, shall, on adequa;e evidence being, pro- duced t) the C unnaitte, be liable to expulsion frmn the club. By private match ia meant one that is not open to all the club member f)r c)mpetition."</p>
